  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAnti-Money Laundering\n\t\tCapium AML\n\n### Biometric checks & Entering the information into Companies House (ACSP)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 30 Jan, 2026 at  4:55 PM\n\n\t\tThe first step you need to is to register as a ACSP.\n\nInformation can be found here on how to do so https://www.gov.uk/guidance/applying-to-register-as-a-companies-house-authorised-agent\n\nOnce registered, you’ll be provided with a new digital account and unique identity number\n\nThen follow these steps.\n\n1. Tell Companies House you have verified someone's identity\n\n2. \n\n3.\n\n4.\n\n5.\n\n6. You confirm various pieces of information about the client, then:\n\n7. Then it asks you information about the document you have checked.\n\nhttps://www.gov.uk/guidance/how-to-meet-companies-house-identity-verification-standard\n\n8. If successful you will be shown this picture below and the client should be sent an IDV to their email address.\n\nMore information can be found here:\nhttps://www.gov.uk/guidance/tell-companies-house-you-have-verified-someones-identity\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000116723\">Anti-Money Laundering</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000193271\">Capium AML</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Biometric checks &amp; Entering the information into Companies House (ACSP)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 30 Jan, 2026 at  4:55 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">The first step you need to is to register as a ACSP.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Information can be found here on how to do so <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/applying-to-register-as-a-companies-house-authorised-agent\">https://www.gov.uk/guidance/applying-to-register-as-a-companies-house-authorised-agent</a><br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once registered, you’ll be provided with a new digital account and unique identity number</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Then follow these steps.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">1. Tell Companies House you have verified someone's identity</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934317/original/TxhVtHmP6HxgjwUKE4B_JZi1gfG3GBXZDA.png?1752075846\" style=\"width: 202px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934317\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">2.&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934476/original/VqQEYu-RzhESuubPG0DGAiALsq4W8_E4YQ.png?1752075942\" style=\"width: 248px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934476\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">3.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934511/original/aG5pzFP6bkLn6b3SD2da42NI-FJQWra3BQ.png?1752075970\" style=\"width: 347px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934511\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">4.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934698/original/BiepdcyUVjGjfWmtYbZRav-UW86yJ61OvA.png?1752076109\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934698\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">5.<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934843/original/Jsjqae6UxuNaYlNNRweUGKAsEbL1XWsSKg.png?1752076206\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934843\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\">6. You confirm various pieces of information about the client, then:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233934937/original/yyhnfDgDWSuE7SBHnQxAGzkQPxANbwiipA.png?1752076279\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233934937\">7. Then it asks you information about the document you have checked.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/how-to-meet-companies-house-identity-verification-standard\">https://www.gov.uk/guidance/how-to-meet-companies-house-identity-verification-standard</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">8. If successful you will be shown this picture below and the client should be sent an IDV to their email address.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233935256/original/cNqWTNRU2fKSONnzeBt4GKww_J-4ghmvFg.png?1752076485\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9233935256\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">More information can be found here:<br><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/tell-companies-house-you-have-verified-someones-identity\">https://www.gov.uk/guidance/tell-companies-house-you-have-verified-someones-identity</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000269284\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000269284/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000269284\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000269284/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000269284\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"